ne</strong>: Battle your friends in local couch multiplayer, or invite your online Steam friends to join you via <i>Steam Remote Play</i>! Your friends do not even need to own the game to join the fun. <i>[other players need a Controller to play]</i><br></li><li><strong>CPU players</strong>: All modes can be played with or against capable CPU players. You can control their difficulty settings and even give commands to your CPU allies!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.poster.avif?t=1749937750\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.webm?t=1749937750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/58d2732f6a3e44b2fcd8fa198408fc59.mp4?t=1749937750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pick the <strong>Tank</strong> that suits your playstyle or master them all!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique traits:</strong> Every Tank has unique stats, traits, movement methods and weaponry. They all feel different to play.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> All Tanks have unique inherent Abilities, from a Charged Shot over a Defense Drone to a short-range Teleport. Use them in key moments to surprise your foes!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.poster.avif?t=1749937750\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/3fc38a9f89bb126e1f64fc47090a3cba.webm?t=1749937750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar